stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> WAITING
  WAITING --> COMMIT: Bracket fills pair
  COMMIT --> REVEAL: Two valid distinct signed commitments
  COMMIT --> RESOLVED: Commit deadline / forfeit
  REVEAL --> RESOLVED: Two openings or reveal deadline
  RESOLVED --> COMMIT: Tie or more wins required
  RESOLVED --> NEXT_MATCH: Match winner advances
  NEXT_MATCH --> WAITING: Next bracket pairing incomplete
  NEXT_MATCH --> COMMIT: Next bracket pairing complete
  NEXT_MATCH --> CHAMPION: Final winner
